{"ref":"BDB, מְשַׁמָּה²","hw":"מְשַׁמָּה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְשַׁמָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> = <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמָּה</span>;—abs.<br><strong>1.</strong>  = <em>devastation, waste</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָתַתִּי אֶת־הָאָרֶץ שְׁמָמָה וּמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.14\">Ez 6:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.28\">33:28</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 33:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.33.29\">29</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.3\">35:3</a>, + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.7\">35:7a</a>, v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שְׁמָמָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שְׁמָמָה\">שְׁמָמָה</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשַׁמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.6\">Is 15:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">Je 48:34</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>horror</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָֽיְתָה חֶרְפָּה</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">וּמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.15\">Ez 5:15</a>.","next":"BDB, שָׁ֫מָּה²","prev":"BDB, שִׁמָּמוֹן"}